<title>SWEDEN: TABLE-ASTRA LARGEST PRODUCTS H1 SALES.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ASTRA LARGEST PRODUCTS H1 SALES.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish drugs company Astra AB reported on Friday the following sales for its largest products for the first half of 1997 compared to the same period a year ago. (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p>				     H1 1997     H1 1996   (pct change)</p>
<p> Losec			     10,015   vs   8,551*	 17</p>
<p> Pulmicort			  2,480   vs   2,292	   8</p>
<p> Seloken			    1,477   vs   1,237	  19</p>
<p> Plendil			    1,129   vs     979	  15</p>
<p> Xylocaine			    893   vs     865	   3</p>
<p> Rhinocort			    638   vs     534	  20</p>
<p> Bricanyl			     636   vs     632	   1</p>
<p> Imdur				  439   vs     401	  10</p>
<p> Marcaine			     334   vs     312	   7</p>
<p> Ramace				 257   vs     232	  11</p>
<p>NOTE - A * indicates these are figures for Astra's sales of Losec. Total Losec sales in the world market were 14.72 billion crowns in the first half of 1997 against 11.78 billion a year ago.    -- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1045</p>
</text>
